{
  "slug": "prompt-enhancer-pack",
  "name": "Prompt Enhancer Pack",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Auto-enhances vague prompts into well-structured, context-aware prompts before Claude responds. Includes four skills: /enhance (general), /enhance-code (detects your tech stack from package.json, requirements.txt, etc. and tailors the prompt), /enhance-writing (classifies into 6 writing types and applies the right framework), and /enhance-for (rewrites for ChatGPT, Gemini, Cursor, or Copilot).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `enhance` (Enhance a vague or rough prompt into a well-structured, comprehensive prompt before responding), `enhance-code` (Enhance a vague coding prompt into a detailed, developer-focused prompt), `enhance-for` (Enhance a prompt optimized for a specific AI platform (ChatGPT, Gemini, Cursor, Copilot, Claude)), `enhance-writing` (Enhance a vague writing prompt into a detailed creative brief with audience, tone, structure, and quality constraints)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install prompt-enhancer-pack@claude-community` from `SivaJyothiPamarthy/prompt-enhancer-pack`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
